genetic map positions and cM values differ in length (2 vs 1)

# Empty map.
statement error
SELECT duckhts_roh_segments([1000], [0.3], [[0, 30, 60]], []::BIGINT[], []::DOUBLE[], NULL::DOUBLE, 6.7e-8, 5e-9);
